    13.0m\r\n\r\nInterpretation:\r\n  Headline rank is median\u0394 on Peaked scenarios
    \u2014 that's the only metric\r\n  where 'algorithm accuracy' is meaningful.
    Diffuse scenarios have no peak\r\n  and exist only to surface noise-floor behavior.\r\n\r\n 
    Use this report as the falsifiable contract for any redesign. A candidate\r\n 
    algorithm must beat the current production row (GridArgmax17) on at least\r\n 
    one of median\u0394 / medianMass% / medianMs without regressing the other two.\r\n"
